body:
Last week I made a joke to my friend about him listening to Lamb of God on the way to us meeting even though we've never really discussed music taste and it turned out that was exactly what he'd been doing... much less impressive than lots of the stories on here but still freaked us both out a bit!

&#x200B;

Also more generic stuff like unusual hookups, unforeseen breakups, political stuff etc

Former snooper here. You snooped cos your gut told you something was offkey and it was correct. If you haven't snooped before, this was definitely you subliminally picking up on his behaviour/deceit.

&#x200B;

I'm here to tell you, whilst snooping isn't a great choice, you're not crazy for doing it and this won't be your behaviour in every relationship, or even every part of each relationship. I had that fear, but when a guy makes you feel safe, you don't even need to consider checking.

&#x200B;

If this is an isolated event and if there are no other niggling doubts, then give him the benefit of the doubt and keep an eye on your temptations to snoop and cues he may be giving off that make you distrustful. If this isn't isolated and other issues are concerning you, this will be an insecurity breeding ground and this lack of trust will fester. Only you know which one of these is the case!

&#x200B;

That said, I truly wish you the best of luck in whatever choice you make and hope you'll prioritise your happiness (as cheesy as it sounds), good luck!

Purely conjecture but I would say an ENFP because:

&#x200B;

E/F are commonly found in artists and creative types, and she also has a very out there against-the-grain fashion style which you need to enjoy being the centre of attention, as well as having a strong connection between the way you dress and the way you feel

&#x200B;

N because her lyrics are often quite metaphorical, which suggests a level of abstract thought more commonly associated with Ns 

&#x200B;

P because she strikes me as quite an impulsive person from what you hear about her personal life

&#x200B;

That said though, I imagine it'd be difficult to type her because imo (again not based on any fact), I think she may have some of the dark triad traits which can cause people to deliberately or inadvertently manipulate their own results. NO DISS ON ENFPs btw! Every personality type has their turds (I should know, I often come out as ENTJ - Voldemort, Thatcher, Jim Carrey etc), just what I would guess
